    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>A database contains the tables Student(StudentID, Name, Form) and Result(StudentID, Subject, Mark).</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write an SQL query to list the name and mark of every student who scored more than 70 in Maths, with the highest mark first.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Explain what is meant by a foreign key.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Example answer:</div></div>\n<pre class=\"q-code\"><code>SELECT Student.Name, Result.Mark\nFROM Student INNER JOIN Result ON Student.StudentID = Result.StudentID\nWHERE Result.Subject = 'Maths' AND Result.Mark &gt; 70\nORDER BY Result.Mark DESC;</code></pre>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Correct fields selected</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Tables joined on StudentID</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Both conditions in WHERE</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">ORDER BY Mark DESC</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">A field in one table that is the primary key of another table, used to link the two</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
