    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>A company plans to use an artificial intelligence system to decide which job applicants are invited to interview.</p>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Discuss the moral, ethical and legal issues that the company should consider.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(9)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<p>Marked by level of response: 7–9 marks for a thorough, balanced discussion with a justified conclusion.</p>\n<p>Indicative content:</p>\n<ul><li>Bias: a system trained on past decisions may reproduce discrimination against some groups</li><li>Transparency: applicants may be unable to find out why they were rejected</li><li>Accountability: who is responsible for an unfair decision</li><li>Legislation: the Data Protection Act and the Equality Act apply to automated decisions and personal data</li><li>Benefits: consistent, fast screening of large numbers of applications</li><li>Mitigation: human review of decisions, auditing outcomes and testing for bias</li></ul>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
